1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Welcome to Python 101. Today we cover lists, aka dynamic arrays.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Use append() to add one item. Prefer list comprehensions for transforms.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Mutable default arguments are a common bug; use None and assign inside.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Big-O for append is amortized O(1). Indexing by position is O(1).
